॰ `जाल` NARROWS the repertoire, it does not disable it. Exactly the twelve marks
॰ `lex.rs:601`-`:613` names — < > = " / - ! SPACE { } ; : — and the two ASCII
॰ letter classes. Anything else is still refused inside a `जाल` directive, which
॰ is what makes it an exemption rather than a hole.
